\text{Escalate}
\end{cases} \\
\downarrow \\
\text{New Observation } X_{t+1} \\
\downarrow \\
\mathcal{M}_{t+1} \subseteq \mathcal{M}_t \text{ (potentially)} \\
\downarrow \\
W_{t+1} = W_t - \Delta W_t \\
\circlearrowleft
\end{array}
}

The loop is crucial. The AI does not "discover the user's true state." It attempts to reduce the set of plausible models enough to choose a safer action.

